SecMLOps lab — generated credentials
=====================================
Generated on first provision. Keep this file on the VM only.

S3 (VersityGW)  http://s3.{{ lab_domain }}:7070
  access key {{ s3_access_key }}
  secret key {{ s3_secret_key }}
  buckets    mlflow, ml-data, harbor  (top-level dirs under /data/secmlops/s3)

Harbor       http://harbor.{{ lab_domain }}:{{ harbor_http_port }}
  user       admin
  password   {{ harbor_admin_password }}

OpenBao      http://bao.{{ lab_domain }}:8200
  root token {{ bao_root_token }}
  seeded     secret/mlops/{s3, harbor, cosign, pomerium, secobserve}
  policies   ci-mlops, ci-sign      auth mounts  jwt-github, jwt-gitlab, jwt-azure

MLflow       http://mlflow.{{ lab_domain }}:5000
SecObserve   http://secobserve.{{ lab_domain }}:8081  (admin / {{ secobserve_admin_password }})
Grafana      http://grafana.{{ lab_domain }}:3000  (admin / {{ grafana_admin_password }})

Cosign keypair: {{ stacks_root }}/cosign.key (+ .pub)
  password stored in OpenBao at secret/mlops/cosign

These are LAB credentials. Rotate everything for any non-lab use.
